OL,3,AGrindr to pay #26m to settle claims it
OL,4,Aallegedly shared users' HIV status
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to a US regulatory filing,
OL,7,FGrindr will make two #13m payments to
OL,8,Fsettle the claims. The firm said the
OL,9,Fsettlement includes no admission of
OL,10,Fliability.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
